      <div>
        <div style="text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORPORATION</div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 5pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">RECONCILIATION OF GAAP VERSUS NON-GAAP DISCLOSURES</div>
